  npcName: Receptionist
  dialogueLines:
  - Hello, welcome to WoodVine. What can I help you?
  - "Oh, if you want to know, ok. Uhm, Mia, this is the first floor. Its has 4 room:
    Reception, Electric Room, \nElevator Room and Storage Room."
  - 'On the right side is Electric Room, bottm left is Elevator Room, bottom right
    is Storage Room. '
  - If you want to investigate, maybe you should pick up the flash light first.Its
    on the next table at the center of Reception.
  - 'In case that the building lost electric, please come back to me. '
